  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate a Girl, Educate a Nation - iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unfortunately, in many iraq families, girls traditionally have relatively less or limited access to educational opportunities as boys receive education preference. We are helping to level the playing field by providing scholarships to girls at risk of dropping out of school. The girls receive guidance to help them stay on track with their educational goals. They also receive reproductive health education. This helps ensure that they don&apos;t drop out of school due to early motherhood.</narrative>
  </description>
